### Content Management (for `docs/**/*.md` files)

- New articles are created as `.md` files within the appropriate subdirectories of `docs/`.
- When adding images, place them in the same directory as the article or a subdirectory. Reference them with relative paths.
- `python site_manager.py optimize` will automatically process and optimize any new images (also runs during `site_manager.py build`).
- Before committing, it's good practice to run `python site_manager.py check` to find broken image or media links.
- Every page carries YAML frontmatter with `date`, `modified`, `description` and `tags`. Run `python scripts/update_frontmatter.py --all` after adding pages to fill these in; dates are derived from git history and feed the RSS feed.